        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27953-27968"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27968-27986">によるとあの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27986-28004"><rb>女</rb><rt>をんな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28004-28022">は、わたしが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28022-28049"><rb>太刀打</rb><rt>たちうち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28049-28052">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28052-28067"><rb>始</rb><rt>はじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28067-28076">めるが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28076-28091"><rb>早</rb><rt>はや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28091-28100">いか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28100-28115"><rb>人</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28115-28118">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28118-28133"><rb>助</rb><rt>たす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28133-28142">けでも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28142-28154"><rb>呼</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28154-28157">ぶ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28157-28172"><rb>爲</rb><rt>ため</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28172-28178">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28178-28193"><rb>藪</rb><rt>やぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28193-28208">をくぐつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28208-28220"><rb>逃</rb><rt>に</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28220-28235">げたのかも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28235-28247"><rb>知</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28247-28283">れない。――わたしはさう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28283-28301"><rb>考</rb><rt>かんが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28301-28313">へると、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28313-28334"><rb>今度</rb><rt>こんど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28334-28349">はわたしの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend