        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-29470-29485">――その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29485-29500"><rb>紺</rb><rt>こん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29500-29503">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29503-29527"><rb>水干</rb><rt>すゐかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29527-29530">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29530-29542"><rb>着</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29542-29545">た</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29545-29563"><rb>男</rb><rt>をとこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29563-29581">は、わたしを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29581-29593"><rb>手</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29593-29623">ごめにしてしまふと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29623-29638"><rb>縛</rb><rt>しば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29638-29647">られた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29647-29665"><rb>夫</rb><rt>をつと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29665-29668">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29668-29683"><rb>眺</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29683-29698">めながら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29698-29716"><rb>嘲</rb><rt>あざけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29716-29728">るやうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29728-29743"><rb>笑</rb><rt>わら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29743-29758">ひました。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29758-29776"><rb>夫</rb><rt>をつと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29776-29791">はどんなに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29791-29812"><rb>無念</rb><rt>むねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29812-29848">だつたでせう。が、いくら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29848-29869"><rb>身悶</rb><rt>みもだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29869-29887">えをしても、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29887-29914"><rb>體中</rb><rt>からだぢう</rt></ruby><seg source